### relative path to sh
#!bin/sh
echo "relative"
>>> SC2239 1:1

### interpreter without any slash
#!sh
uname -a
>>> SC2239 1:1

### shell directive that also ignores the code is fine
#!bin/sh
# shellcheck shell=sh disable=SC2239
echo "relative"
>>> none

### shell directive alone is fine
#!bin/sh
# shellcheck shell=sh
echo "relative"
>>> none
